{"logId": "20a3b147-6cc5-4608-acab-1bbed1124409", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第九章 假期", "block_bbox": [1167, 99, 1506, 159], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[1167.0, 99.0], [1506.0, 99.0], [1506.0, 159.0], [1167.0, 159.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、婚假", "block_bbox": [85, 243, 272, 291], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[85.0, 243.0], [272.0, 243.0], [272.0, 291.0], [85.0, 291.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "凡达到法定年龄结婚的员工，可享受以下休假标准：", "block_bbox": [162, 306, 1117, 358], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[162.0, 306.0], [1117.0, 306.0], [1117.0, 358.0], [162.0, 358.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 在公司工龄不满三年，可一次性连续休假3天。", "block_bbox": [161, 371, 1052, 421], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 371.0], [1052.0, 371.0], [1052.0, 421.0], [161.0, 421.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在公司工龄满三年，可一次性连续休假5天（初婚）。", "block_bbox": [159, 435, 1182, 486], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 435.0], [1182.0, 435.0], [1182.0, 486.0], [159.0, 486.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 在公司工龄满五年以上，可一次性连续休假10天（初婚）。", "block_bbox": [161, 499, 1283, 552], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 499.0], [1283.0, 499.0], [1283.0, 552.0], [161.0, 552.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "婚假期间工资、奖金照发。", "block_bbox": [165, 564, 661, 614], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 564.0], [661.0, 564.0], [661.0, 614.0], [165.0, 614.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、产假", "block_bbox": [85, 628, 270, 678], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[85.0, 628.0], [270.0, 628.0], [270.0, 678.0], [85.0, 678.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 年龄达到计划生育规定（23岁零4个月），在公司工作的已婚女员工，可享受产假，标准如下：", "block_bbox": [159, 692, 1923, 744], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 692.0], [1923.0, 692.0], [1923.0, 744.0], [159.0, 744.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "(1)连续工龄不满三年，可享受3个月产假；", "block_bbox": [222, 757, 998, 808], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[222.0, 757.0], [998.0, 757.0], [998.0, 808.0], [222.0, 808.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "(2)连续工龄满四一六年，可享受6个月产假；", "block_bbox": [223, 822, 1038, 872], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 822.0], [1038.0, 822.0], [1038.0, 872.0], [223.0, 872.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "(3)连续工龄满七年以上，可享受10个月产假；", "block_bbox": [223, 886, 1060, 936], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[223.0, 886.0], [1060.0, 886.0], [1060.0, 936.0], [223.0, 936.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 男员工配偶生育（一胎）给予3天带薪假期；被评为公司年度优秀员工的男员工配偶在本年度内生育，可另给予4天带薪陪护假期。", "block_bbox": [159, 950, 2563, 1002], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 950.0], [2563.0, 950.0], [2563.0, 1002.0], [159.0, 1002.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 计划内怀孕满五个月可离岗休假，怀孕未满五个月之前如身体原因不能正常工作，也可提前离岗，期间按病假计算。", "block_bbox": [160, 1015, 2325, 1066], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[160.0, 1015.0], [2325.0, 1015.0], [2325.0, 1066.0], [160.0, 1066.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 产假到期应提前一周带婴儿出生证明到公司办公室报到，逾期未报到者，视为自动离职。", "block_bbox": [160, 1078, 1825, 1131], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[160.0, 1078.0], [1825.0, 1078.0], [1825.0, 1131.0], [160.0, 1131.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 哺乳不满周岁婴儿的女员工，享有上、下午各半小时哺乳时间。", "block_bbox": [161, 1144, 1367, 1195], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 1144.0], [1367.0, 1144.0], [1367.0, 1195.0], [161.0, 1195.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6. 休孕假不上报公司者，视为自动离职。", "block_bbox": [162, 1208, 907, 1259], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[162.0, 1208.0], [907.0, 1208.0], [907.0, 1259.0], [162.0, 1259.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7. 二胎怀孕无准生证者，视为自动离职。", "block_bbox": [164, 1272, 908, 1323], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 1272.0], [908.0, 1272.0], [908.0, 1323.0], [164.0, 1323.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8. 产假期满，如有特殊原因不能上岗者，最长可延期6个月", "block_bbox": [163, 1336, 1237, 1388], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 1336.0], [1237.0, 1336.0], [1237.0, 1388.0], [163.0, 1388.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三、丧假", "block_bbox": [88, 1400, 271, 1451], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[88.0, 1400.0], [271.0, 1400.0], [271.0, 1451.0], [88.0, 1451.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 公司员工，其父母、岳父母、公婆、配偶、子女去世，可给予3天丧假。", "block_bbox": [161, 1465, 1510, 1517], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 1465.0], [1510.0, 1465.0], [1510.0, 1517.0], [161.0, 1517.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在公司工龄满一年以上，去世亲属不在本省的员工，经部门核实后，可另享有2天的路程假。", "block_bbox": [159, 1530, 1883, 1581], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[159.0, 1530.0], [1883.0, 1530.0], [1883.0, 1581.0], [159.0, 1581.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 丧假期间工资、奖金照发。", "block_bbox": [161, 1595, 704, 1645], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 1595.0], [704.0, 1595.0], [704.0, 1645.0], [161.0, 1645.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、病假", "block_bbox": [88, 1659, 271, 1708], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[88.0, 1659.0], [271.0, 1659.0], [271.0, 1708.0], [88.0, 1708.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 员工因病请假7天以内的，由本人持医疗单位证明，部门主管核准后，方可休假。", "block_bbox": [161, 1722, 1675, 1775], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[161.0, 1722.0], [1675.0, 1722.0], [1675.0, 1775.0], [161.0, 1775.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "23", "block_bbox": [2659, 1870, 2715, 1903], "block_id": 25, "block_order": null, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[2659.0, 1870.0], [2715.0, 1870.0], [2715.0, 1903.0], [2659.0, 1903.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8622835278511047, "coordinate": [1167, 99, 1506, 159], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[1167.0, 99.0], [1506.0, 99.0], [1506.0, 159.0], [1167.0, 159.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8636502623558044, "coordinate": [85, 243, 272, 291], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[85.0, 243.0], [272.0, 243.0], [272.0, 291.0], [85.0, 291.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8796065449714661, "coordinate": [162, 306, 1117, 358], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[162.0, 306.0], [1117.0, 306.0], [1117.0, 358.0], [162.0, 358.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8802274465560913, "coordinate": [161, 371, 1052, 421], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[161.0, 371.0], [1052.0, 371.0], [1052.0, 421.0], [161.0, 421.0]]}, {"cls_