ext", "score": 0.8737860918045044, "coordinate": [160, 1078, 1825, 1131], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[160.0, 1078.0], [1825.0, 1078.0], [1825.0, 1131.0], [160.0, 1131.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8793790936470032, "coordinate": [161, 1144, 1367, 1195], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[161.0, 1144.0], [1367.0, 1144.0], [1367.0, 1195.0], [161.0, 1195.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.871745228767395, "coordinate": [162, 1208, 907, 1259], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[162.0, 1208.0], [907.0, 1208.0], [907.0, 1259.0], [162.0, 1259.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8858768343925476, "coordinate": [164, 1272, 908, 1323], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[164.0, 1272.0], [908.0, 1272.0], [908.0, 1323.0], [164.0, 1323.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8848826885223389, "coordinate": [163, 1336, 1237, 1388], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 1336.0], [1237.0, 1336.0], [1237.0, 1388.0], [163.0, 1388.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.885585367679596, "coordinate": [88, 1400, 271, 1451], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[88.0, 1400.0], [271.0, 1400.0], [271.0, 1451.0], [88.0, 1451.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8903990387916565, "coordinate": [161, 1465, 1510, 1517], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[161.0, 1465.0], [1510.0, 1465.0], [1510.0, 1517.0], [161.0, 1517.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8981163501739502, "coordinate": [159, 1530, 1883, 1581], "order": 22, "polygon_points": [[159.0, 1530.0], [1883.0, 1530.0], [1883.0, 1581.0], [159.0, 1581.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8573872447013855, "coordinate": [161, 1595, 704, 1645], "order": 23, "polygon_points": [[161.0, 1595.0], [704.0, 1595.0], [704.0, 1645.0], [161.0, 1645.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8868563175201416, "coordinate": [88, 1659, 271, 1708], "order": 24, "polygon_points": [[88.0, 1659.0], [271.0, 1659.0], [271.0, 1708.0], [88.0, 1708.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8766458034515381, "coordinate": [161, 1722, 1675, 1775], "order": 25, "polygon_points": [[161.0, 1722.0], [1675.0, 1722.0], [1675.0, 1775.0], [161.0, 1775.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7287032008171082, "coordinate": [2659, 1870, 2715, 1903], "order": 26, "polygon_points": [[2659.0, 1870.0], [2715.0, 1870.0], [2715.0, 1903.0], [2659.0, 1903.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 第九章 假期\n\n## 一、 婚假\n\n凡达到法定年龄结婚的员工，可享受以下休假标准：\n\n1. 在公司工龄不满三年，可一次性连续休假3天。\n\n2. 在公司工龄满三年，可一次性连续休假5天（初婚）。\n\n3. 在公司工龄满五年以上，可一次性连续休假10天（初婚）。\n\n婚假期间工资、奖金照发。\n\n## 二、 产假\n\n1. 年龄达到计划生育规定（23岁零4个月），在公司工作的已婚女员工，可享受产假，标准如下：\n\n(1)连续工龄不满三年，可享受3个月产假；\n\n(2)连续工龄满四一六年，可享受6个月产假；\n\n(3)连续工龄满七年以上，可享受10个月产假；\n\n2. 男员工配偶生育（一胎）给予3天带薪假期；被评为公司年度优秀员工的男员工配偶在本年度内生育，可另给予4天带薪陪护假期。\n\n3. 计划内怀孕满五个月可离岗休假，怀孕未满五个月之前如身体原因不能正常工作，也可提前离岗，期间按病假计算。\n\n4. 产假到期应提前一周带婴儿出生证明到公司办公室报到，逾期未报到者，视为自动离职。\n\n5. 哺乳不满周岁婴儿的女员工，享有上、下午各半小时哺乳时间。\n\n6. 休孕假不上报公司者，视为自动离职。\n\n7. 二胎怀孕无准生证者，视为自动离职。\n\n8. 产假期满，如有特殊原因不能上岗者，最长可延期6个月\n\n## 三、 丧假\n\n1. 公司员工，其父母、岳父母、公婆、配偶、子女去世，可给予3天丧假。\n\n2. 在公司工龄满一年以上，去世亲属不在本省的员工，经部门核实后，可另享有2天的路程假。\n\n3. 丧假期间工资、奖金照发。\n\n## 四、 病假\n\n1. 员工因病请假7天以内的，由本人持医疗单位证明，部门主管核准后，方可休假。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//20a3b147-6cc5-4608-acab-1bbed1124409/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F465588ef5b682b1b40472ca3f7ad1dfb8d79b77c33bd57b0522d31830e477cdd"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//20a3b147-6cc5-4608-acab-1bbed1124409/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff8ffbe91b4a0ea71b43f313b15921388e7c4ad25fc0bdba02202437917e43247"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 2800, "height": 2000}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//20a3b147-6cc5-4608-acab-1bbed1124409/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A38%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F716d36cde5fc8c681bde33bba577e1fea82d440b062e124111e07475c3068abd"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
